* Has the following unit additional properties:
** Each summoned unit has its own independent duration.
** {{Symbol|Attack Damage}}
*** Automatically issues an attack order in 0.1-second intervals according to the following chase priorities:
**** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} {{A|Warlock|Fatal Bonds}}-affected Enemy Units {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} Nearest Enemy Unit {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} {{M|Buildings}}
*** Hence, the Minor Imps continue chasing its target when affected by {{M|dominated}} sources.
**** Targets the following units:
***** {{M|Debuff immune}} units.
***** {{M|Fogged units}}.
***** {{M|Invisible}} units.
***** {{M|Untargetable}} units.
**** Does not target the following units:
***** {{M|Hidden}} units.
***** {{M|Invulnerable}} units.
** {{A|Minor Imp|Eldritch Explosion}} 
*** The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} component is sourced to Warlock.

* Has two proc conditions to summon {{U|Minor Imp}} of the corresponding level upon the unit's {{M|death}}:
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*** Checks if the caster has this {{M|innate}} ability to summon the units. Hence, it does not consider the following sources.
**** Debuffs applied sourced to the {{U|Warlock Golem}}
**** Debuffs applied from {{M|Spell Reflection}} sources.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]]
*** Only the following abilities' first applied buff or offensive debuffs are considered valid:
**** {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
***** {{A|Warlock|Fatal Bonds}}
***** {{A|Warlock|Shadow Word}}
***** {{A|Warlock|Upheaval}}
***** Explicitly upon the {{A|Warlock|Chaotic Offering}} {{Symbol|Stun}} {{Code|modifier_stunned}} applied.
**** {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
***** {{A|Warlock|Shadow Word}}
***** {{A|Warlock|Upheaval}}
****** {{Symbol|bonus t2r}} The ally bonus {{M|attack speed}} component.
*** {{Symbol|Death}}
**** Procs in the following death sources:
***** {{M|Reincarnation}} sources.
***** {{M|Instant kill}} sources, except {{A|Ancient Apparition|Ice Blast}}.
**** Does not proc in the following death sources:
***** {{M|Forced kill}} sources.
***** Being killed by {{M|neutral creeps}}.
***** Upon {{M|Deny|text=Denies}}.

* {{cf|talnotes}} {{U|Warlock Golem}} {{M|talent|t=t3r}} do not apply to Minor Imps.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Eldritch Summoning icon0}}
| desc = Whenever an enemy unit dies while afflicted by one or more of Warlock's abilities, a minor imp is summoned that lasts for 15 seconds and explodes on death. Imps will automatically seek out nearby units, favoring fatally bonded heroes, and will explode when reaching their prey.
}}
* {{Symbol|Model Size}}
** Utilizes the same unit model as the {{U|Warlock Golem}}.
** {{cf|cos}} Utilizes the same cosmetic items as well.

